# One C++ style for the whole tree, the ported Expr code included: LLVM's,
# with MLIR's deltas (llvm-project/mlir/.clang-format). The formatter is
# pinned in .pre-commit-config.yaml (clang-format 18.1.8, the major of the
# clang-18 toolchain the build uses). MLIR's WrapNamespaceBodyWithEmptyLines
# needs clang-format 20 and is left out; its value there, Never, does not
# change LLVM style's output.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
AlwaysBreakTemplateDeclarations: Yes
LineEnding: LF
